      "created_at": "2015-03-02T15:13:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It's not those cards alone - I also had a situation where Fanatic got incapped partway through using&nbsp;<em>Exorcism:&nbsp;</em>she dealt 1 melee damage to Blade, got incapacitated by a Backlash Field in response, but was then still able to deal the 1 radiant for the second half of the power despite being incapacitated.</p><p>Edit: It's Case 12629 if you're looking for the bug report, MigrantP.</p>",
